SBI discovers this compatibility source under the Ubuntu Stonking
sip6 6.16.1-2 source identity. The installed SIP generator is 6.17.3,
including the StableKite ABI 14 fixes used by the PyQt6 bindings.
The Debian build retains the ABI 13 test suite. The ABI 14 suite runs
separately on CPython 3.15t.
